{"nodes": [{"id": "apps_mobile_claude_bare_react_native_no_expo", "label": "@heliogrid/mobile \u2014 bare React Native, NO Expo anywhere", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Field-first app; never expo packages, EAS, AsyncStorage for tokens, direct packages/db imports, or domain logic AUTHORED here."}, {"id": "apps_mobile_claude_repositories_data_fence", "label": "All data access behind src/data/repositories.ts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Screens never see fetch/SQLite/sync. Repository types are INFERRED from contracts \u2014 a hand-written HealthStatus interface duplicating the liveness 200 schema drifted silently when the contract gained a field."}, {"id": "apps_mobile_claude_ui_api_parity_typecheck", "label": "src/ui/api-parity.ts \u2014 RN\u2194web component parity as a typecheck", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Parity is asserted against @heliogrid/ui-api, not compared in a gallery; drift fails THIS app's typecheck and names the component."}, {"id": "apps_mobile_claude_screen_folder_shape", "label": "RN keeps src/screens/<name>/ (ADR-0022)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "RN has no router-driven app/ directory, so screen folders already are web's features/ equivalent; the asymmetry is deliberate and must not be 'aligned'. Never a components.tsx or hooks.ts grab-bag \u2014 a file named for its layer instead of its job is the same defect as *-part2."}, {"id": "apps_mobile_claude_80_line_screen_cap", "label": "80-line screen component cap (Biome)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A screen that fetches, holds state, renders and styles in one file passes every other gate \u2014 LoginScreen hit 446 lines and GalleryScreen 406 (2026-07-31). Extract the hook first: logic is what makes the file unreadable, not markup."}, {"id": "apps_mobile_claude_keychain_storage", "label": "Auth tokens via src/auth/keychain-storage.ts only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every fetch uses credentials:'omit' because iOS CFNetwork merges stored cookies into a 401 without absorbSetCookies; the keychain jar is the only cookie path."}, {"id": "apps_mobile_claude_zod_pin_landmine", "label": "apps/mobile pins zod 3.25.76 explicitly", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without it pnpm resolved @ts-rest/core's zod peer to the transitive zod 4 in the store and the typed client collapsed to never \u2014 every api.* call became a type error (2026-07-27)."}, {"id": "apps_mobile_claude_apptext_run_splitting", "label": "AppText Devanagari run-splitting and the typography role", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Geist/Noto TTFs are bundled and Devanagari must be verified on BOTH simulators. a11y/useValidAriaRole is off for this app because AppText's role is a TYPOGRAPHY role (body/h2/overline), not ARIA, and real RN a11y goes through accessibilityRole."}, {"id": "apps_mobile_claude_mobile_app_entry_thin", "label": "mobile-app-entry-thin \u2014 App.tsx never imports a screen", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "App.tsx renders RootNavigator only; navigation is by typed route name from src/navigation/routes.ts, never prop callbacks."}, {"id": "apps_mobile_claude_env_single_config_point", "label": "src/env.ts \u2014 the app's one configuration decision point", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bare RN has no runtime process.env, so env.ts hands a source to @heliogrid/env/native which owns schema and validation. There is deliberately no src/config/ \u2014 a new folder category would need an ADR (Law 2)."}], "edges": [{"source": "apps_mobile_claude_bare_react_native_no_expo", "target": "apps_mobile_claude_repositories_data_fence", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_bare_react_native_no_expo", "target": "_claude_rules_00_laws_law7_cross_platform_lockstep", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_ui_api_parity_typecheck", "target": "_claude_rules_00_laws_law7_cross_platform_lockstep", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_screen_folder_shape", "target": "apps_web_claude_app_routes_features_owns", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_screen_folder_shape", "target": "claude_file_size_split_law", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_80_line_screen_cap", "target": "_claude_rules_ui_adherence_presentation_logic_split", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_repositories_data_fence", "target": "_claude_rules_contracts_one_zenum_per_business_set", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_repositories_data_fence", "target": "apps_web_claude_api_client_only", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_zod_pin_landmine", "target": "_claude_rules_contracts_zod3_pin", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_apptext_run_splitting", "target": "_claude_rules_i18n_devanagari_width_expansion", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_bare_react_native_no_expo", "target": "_claude_rules_i18n_runtime_trans_convention", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/mobile/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "apps_mobile_claude_env_single_co